  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: You have unlocked the Freeze Timer!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Vous avez d\xE9verrouill\xE9 la minuterie de gel!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Sie haben den Gefrier -Timer freigeschaltet!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Hai sbloccato il timer di congelamento!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30D5\u30EA\u30FC\u30BA\u30BF\u30A4\u30DE\u30FC\u306E\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u89E3\u9664\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB3D9\uACB0 \uD0C0\uC774\uBA38\uB97C \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Voc\xEA desbloqueou o cron\xF4metro de congelamento!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0412\u044B \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0438
      \u0442\u0430\u0439\u043C\u0435\u0440 \u0437\u0430\u043C\u043E\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043D\u0438\u044F!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "\xA1Has desbloqueado el temporizador de congelaci\xF3n!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
