  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: It can be used to clear a single block.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Il peut \xEAtre utilis\xE9 pour effacer un seul bloc."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Es kann verwendet werden, um einen einzelnen Block zu l\xF6schen."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: "Pu\xF2 essere usato per cancellare un singolo blocco."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u5358\u4E00\u306E\u30D6\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30A2\u3059\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\u4F7F\u7528\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uB2E8\uC77C \uBE14\uB85D\uC744 \uC9C0\uC6B0\uB294 \uB370 \uC0AC\uC6A9\uD560
      \uC218 \uC788\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Pode ser usado para limpar um \xFAnico bloco."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0415\u0433\u043E \u043C\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E \u0438\u0441\u043F\u043E\u043B\u044C\u0437\u043E\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044C
      \u0434\u043B\u044F \u043E\u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043A\u0438 \u043E\u0434\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E
      \u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0430."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Se puede usar para borrar un solo bloque.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
