  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Keep optional ads for rewards!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Conservez les publicit\xE9s facultatives pour les r\xE9compenses\_!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "Behalten Sie optionale Anzeigen f\xFCr Pr\xE4mien!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Mantieni gli annunci facoltativi per i premi!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u5831\u916C\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u30AA\u30D7\u30B7\u30E7\u30F3\u306E\u5E83\u544A\u3092\u4FDD\u5B58\u3057\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uBCF4\uC0C1\uC744 \uC704\uD574 \uC120\uD0DD\uC801 \uAD11\uACE0\uB97C
      \uC720\uC9C0\uD558\uC138\uC694!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Mantenha an\xFAncios opcionais para recompensas!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0421\u043E\u0445\u0440\u0430\u043D\u044F\u0439\u0442\u0435 \u043D\u0435\u043E\u0431\u044F\u0437\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043B\u044C\u043D\u0443\u044E
      \u0440\u0435\u043A\u043B\u0430\u043C\u0443 \u0438 \u043F\u043E\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0439\u0442\u0435
      \u0432\u043E\u0437\u043D\u0430\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "\xA1Mantenga anuncios opcionales para obtener recompensas!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
