--- !u!114 &804682867
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 804682865}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb15fa0e7301ff849bf4d6dcede7c12b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Remove ads between levels and banners in the game
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Supprimez les publicit\xE9s entre les niveaux et les banni\xE8res du jeu"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Entfernen Sie Werbung zwischen Levels und Bannern im Spiel
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Rimuovi gli annunci tra i livelli e i banner nel gioco
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u30B2\u30FC\u30E0\u5185\u306E\u30EC\u30D9\u30EB\u9593\u306E\u5E83\u544A\u3068\u30D0\u30CA\u30FC\u3092\u524A\u9664\u3057\u307E\u3059"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uAC8C\uC784 \uB0B4 \uB808\uBCA8\uACFC \uBC30\uB108 \uC0AC\uC774\uC758
      \uAD11\uACE0 \uC81C\uAC70"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Remova an\xFAncios entre n\xEDveis e banners do jogo"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0423\u0431\u0440\u0430\u0442\u044C \u0440\u0435\u043A\u043B\u0430\u043C\u0443
      \u043C\u0435\u0436\u0434\u0443 \u0443\u0440\u043E\u0432\u043D\u044F\u043C\u0438
      \u0438 \u0431\u0430\u043D\u043D\u0435\u0440\u044B \u0432 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u0435"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Elimina anuncios entre niveles y banners en el juego.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
