  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: You have unlocked the Arrow Block!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Vous avez d\xE9verrouill\xE9 le bloc de fl\xE8ches!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Sie haben den Pfeilblock freigeschaltet!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Hai sbloccato il blocco freccia!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u77E2\u5370\u30D6\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u306E\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u89E3\u9664\u3057\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uD654\uC0B4\uD45C \uBE14\uB85D\uC744 \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C\uD588\uC2B5\uB2C8\uB2E4!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: "Voc\xEA desbloqueou o bloco de seta!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u0412\u044B \u0440\u0430\u0437\u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0438\u0440\u043E\u0432\u0430\u043B\u0438
      \u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0435\u043B\u043A\u0438!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "\xA1Has desbloqueado el bloque de flecha!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
