  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  data: 0
  entries:
  - Language: English
    Text: Clears all the blocks of selected color.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: French
    Text: "Efface tous les blocs de couleur s\xE9lectionn\xE9e."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: "L\xF6scht alle Bl\xF6cke ausgew\xE4hlter Farbe."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Cancella tutti i blocchi di colore selezionato.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Japanese
    Text: "\u9078\u629E\u3057\u305F\u8272\u306E\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306E\u30D6\u30ED\u30C3\u30AF\u3092\u30AF\u30EA\u30A2\u3057\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Korean
    Text: "\uC120\uD0DD\uD55C \uC0C9\uC0C1\uC758 \uBAA8\uB4E0 \uBE14\uB85D\uC744
      \uC9C0 \uC6C1\uB2C8\uB2E4."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Portuguese
    Text: Limpa todos os blocos de cor selecionada.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Russian
    Text: "\u041E\u0447\u0438\u0449\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0432\u0441\u0435 \u0431\u043B\u043E\u043A\u0438
      \u0432\u044B\u0431\u0440\u0430\u043D\u043D\u043E\u0433\u043E \u0446\u0432\u0435\u0442\u0430."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Borra todos los bloques de color seleccionado.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
