  - Language: French
    Text: "Vous avez d\xE9verrouill\xE9 le marteau!"
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: German
    Text: Sie haben den Hammer freigeschaltet!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Italian
    Text: Hai sbloccato il martello!
    Object: {fileID: 0}
